# Who owns which path. This file is a review *routing* signal: it says whose eyes a change to
# a path wants. The repository setting "require review from code owners" is deliberately left
# off — pull requests here are routinely opened by AInsel agents, and a mandatory human
# sign-off on every merge is not this repo's working rule (see CONTRIBUTING.md; the working
# rule is docs/development.md's "never merge your own").
#
# This file is also the single permanent exemption of scripts/check-no-internal-names.sh:
# naming the maintainer of record is what CODEOWNERS exists to do, so the retired-identifier
# guard skips exactly this file (see the comment above its loop). Do not "fix" the names here
# by copying a fixture login in — the exemption is the design, and this is the only tracked
# file allowed to name a person.

# Everything, unless a line below says otherwise. Swap in an org team once one exists.
